<title>RUSSIA: Russia GAZ automobile maker H1 production rises.</title>
<headline>Russia GAZ automobile maker H1 production rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half ending June 30</p>
<p>				  1997			   1996</p>
<p> Automobiles, total	 106,214			101,574</p>
<p> Trucks, total		 46,409			 42,488</p>
<p> of which Gazelle light</p>
<p>  trucks and minivans	44,797			 34,397</p>
<p> Light automobiles	   59,805			 59,086</p>
<p> Output, trln rbls	    5.19			   4.53</p>
<p>NOTES - Full company name is AO Gorkovsky Avtomobilny Zavod (GAZ).</p>
<p>GAZ makes the Volga sedan.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
